data asrock_altrad8ud_fan_policy_observation_note: String = "Authenticated read-only observations on srv3 (OpenBMC 2.07.00) and srv4 (OpenBMC 3.22.00), 2026-07-27: both select /usr/share/swampd/config-asrr.json through /usr/share/swampd/config.json and run /usr/bin/swampd under phosphor-pid-control.service. Both factory images carried the same TEMP_SOC curve. That curve is an observation owned here, not fleet intent. What changed between versions is the PID-entry topology and Redfish resource shape, not the five factory points. The 3.22 web UI /Managers/bmc/FanControl resource exposes InitialDuty; it does not own these thermal curve points."

