data asrock_altrad8ud_firmware_release_note: String = "Cited from the ALTRAD8UD-1L2T product download table; all rows dated 2026-04-14. The BIOS rows are the load-bearing ones for the 2026-08-11 fleet incident: 'Updated RC to 0ACRB_021' is the MEMORY REFERENCE CODE, and srv3 fails DDR training on Samsung M386A4G40DM0-CPB 32GB 4Rx4 LRDIMMs while running DRAM FW 220414 (2022) under BL1 built 2023-05-17, emitting per-controller WRLVL errors and 'DDR initialization failure. Can't fall back!' on all eight controllers. ONE RELEASE, TWO PACKAGINGS, and they are not interchangeable: the ROM zip carries a bare 33554432-byte ALTRAD8UD-1L2T_3.10.ROM applied from BIOS setup by Instant Flash, which is unreachable on a host that cannot POST; the TAR zip carries obmc-bios-altrad8ud-1l2t-3.10.all.tar, whose MANIFEST declares purpose=...VersionPurpose.Host, version=3.10, MachineName=altrad8ud-1l2t, Type=bios, and which is what the BMC UpdateService consumes out-of-band. Every byte count and digest here was MEASURED on 2026-08-11 by acquiring the artifact and hashing it, never transcribed: the ROM zip at 5359089 bytes, the TAR zip at 5359341, the inner push tar at 33566720. The TAR locator was not published on the product page — it was found by probing the vendor download host and confirmed by HTTP 200 plus successful extraction, so it is weaker provenance than a page-published link and should be re-derived if the vendor reorganizes. The BMC 03.22.00 row remains digest-Absent with an unobserved locator: its image_bytes is the page's stated 27.71MB converted, NOT a Content-Length, so it must not be treated as a fetchable artifact until its own locator is observed."

// THE EXECUTED PAIR that establishes the BIOS-tar prerequisite. Same 33566720
// bytes, two hosts of this board model, opposite outcomes — which is what makes
// the minimum evidence rather than an inference from the vendor page (which
// states no such dependency at all).
data asrock_altrad8ud_bios_310_push_refused_at_bmc_207: extdeps.firmware.types.FirmwarePrerequisiteObservation = extdeps.firmware.types.FirmwarePrerequisiteObservation {
  board: AsrockRackAltrad8ud1l2t,
  subject: HostBios,
  image_kind: OpenBmcWebUiTar,
  gating_target: BmcController,
  gating_version: firmware_semantic_version(major: 2, minor: 7, patch: 0),
  outcome: extdeps.firmware.types.PushRefusedByTarget {
    diagnostic: "Invalid ExtendedVersion: primary-all. Please check MANIFEST file!",
  },
  observed_at: 1786579200000,
}

data asrock_altrad8ud_bios_310_push_accepted_at_bmc_322: extdeps.firmware.types.FirmwarePrerequisiteObservation = extdeps.firmware.types.FirmwarePrerequisiteObservation {
  board: AsrockRackAltrad8ud1l2t,
